    <h1 class="page-title">About this archive</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Bia's Archive is written by a Bachelor of Business (Marketing) student at RMIT University.
        Each week, it examines a different piece of digital marketing theory alongside a current,
        real-world example — from platform strategy and content marketing to consumer behaviour
        and brand positioning.
      </p>
      <p>
        The goal isn't just to summarise the theory, but to test it against what brands are actually
        doing right now, and to build a running record of that thinking over the course of the semester.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
